    "axis": "aesthetics",
    "evidence": "Strong cyber-lab art direction, disciplined cyan/red/yellow semantics, crisp cards, and a clear ROI focal point. However, desktop composition is top-heavy with excessive dead space and a detached explanatory note; tablet headline wrapping feels awkward; mobile is very dense and tall, with cramped ledger labels and tiny low-contrast supporting text. The global header also truncates navigation at tablet/mobile, and the mobile brand name disappears.",
